  10           *   - Init_PESEC_Matrices(): builds D and A from block-size config
  11           *   - Syndrome helpers and delta solver
  12           *   - ECC(): main encode cycle -- redundancy update + parity + output
  13           *
  14           * SEC+DED UPGRADE (W4):
  15           *   After computing the redundancy, a single overall even-parity bit P
  16           *   is computed over all 25 bits (15 data + 10 redundancy).  This
  17           *   expands the physical bus word to 26 bits and upgrades the error
  18           *   model from SEC to SEC+DED.
  19           *
  20           * Portability: Pure algorithmic logic.  The only external call is
