  34          /* [W4] Overall even-parity bit for SEC+DED.
  35           * Computed fresh from all 25 bits (15 data + 10 redundancy) after each
  36           * redundancy update.  Read by output_to_shift_registers() in tx_main.c
  37           * to shift it out as the 26th bit on the bus.
